  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 - Initial Release\n- Single event logging with LogAccessAsync\n- Batch logging with LogAccessBatchAsync (up to 1000 events)\n- Fire-and-forget logging with TryLogAccessAsync\n- Bulk subject tracking for exports (SubjectIds)\n- Dependency injection support via AddGlbaClient extension\n- Automatic retry with exponential backoff\n- Full async/await support",
